      <chord name="A7"/>To <chord name="D"/>Him shall <chord name="G"/>princes <chord name="D"/>bend <chord name="B7"/>the <chord name="Em"/>knee And <chord name="D"/>kings their <chord name="A7"/>glory <chord name="D"/>bring.
      </lines>
