    <verse name="v2">
      <lines>
      <chord name="A7"/>The <chord name="D"/>Lord in <chord name="A7"/>Zion reigneth, <chord name="D"/>and who <chord name="F#7"/>so great <chord name="Bm"/>as He?<br/>
      <chord name="A7"/>The <chord name="D"/>depths of <chord name="G"/>earth <chord name="D"/>are in <chord name="G7"/>His hands; <chord name="A"/>He <chord name="E7"/>rules the <chord name="A"/>mighty sea.<br/>
      <chord name="A"/>O <chord name="A7"/>crown <chord name="D"/>His <chord name="Em"/>Name <chord name="B"/>with <chord name="Em"/>honor, <chord name="E7"/>and <chord name="A"/>let <chord name="E"/>His <chord name="A"/>standard wave,<br/>
      <chord name="A7"/>Till <chord name="D"/>distant <chord name="G"/>isles beyond <chord name="D"/>the <chord name="B7"/>deep <chord name="Em"/>shall own <chord name="D"/>His <chord name="A7"/>power <chord name="D"/>to save.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v3">
      <lines>
      <chord name="A7"/>The <chord name="D"/>Lord in <chord name="A7"/>Zion reigneth, <chord name="D"/>these <chord name="F#7"/>hours to <chord name="Bm"/>Him belong;<br/>
      <chord name="A7"/>O <chord name="D"/>enter now <chord name="G"/>His <chord name="D"/>temple gates, <chord name="G7"/>and <chord name="A"/>fill His <chord name="E7"/>courts <chord name="A"/>with song;<br/>
