      <chord name="A7"/>Exalt <chord name="D"/>the <chord name="G"/>King of <chord name="D"/>heaven <chord name="B7"/>and earth, <chord name="Em"/>and <chord name="D"/>crown Him <chord name="A7"/>Lord <chord name="D"/>of all.
